 Victor Glover and Jeremy Hansen reflect on memorable mission moments, new perspectives, and what comes next after their historic journey around the Moon.","display_url":"go.nasa.gov/4dSkerm","end":279,"expanded_url":"https://go.nasa.gov/4dSkerm","images":[{"height":1080,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113286000667746304/AmELaT5l?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1920},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113286000667746304/AmELaT5l?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":256,"status":200,"title":"Reflections After Artemis II - NASA","unwound_url":"https://www.nasa.gov/podcasts/houston-we-have-a-podcast/reflections-after-artemis-ii/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=1025017095","url":"https://t.co/jZ9Zm5P8Z8"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/A6YIgHFDqB","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112959650551173522/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112959646516269056","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/A6YIgHFDqB"}]},"id":"2112959650551173522","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":73,"impression_count":833959,"like_count":1605,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":154,"retweet_count":212},"text":"\"I just hear over and over again: 'I felt like I went on the mission with you'.\"\n\nArtemis II's Jeremy Hansen and Victor Glover reflect on their historic trip around the Moon — and how life on Earth has been since — in our latest Houston We Have A Podcast: https://t.co/jZ9Zm5P8Z8 https://t.co/A6YIgHFDqB","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112959650551173522"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112958599546679296"]},"author_id":"46648807","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:26:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112958602109473184"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Radio-frequency fingerprinting can help prevent an unsuspecting buyer from buying a substandard device.","display_url":"nist.gov/blogs/taking-m…","end":263,"expanded_url":"https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/measurement-research-could-help-devices-tell-you-if-theyve-been-tampered","images":[{"height":608,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112958603313242112/dgsppXpx?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1080},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112958603313242112/dgsppXpx?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":240,"status":200,"title":"Measurement Research Could Help Devices Tell You If They’ve Been Tampered With","unwound_url":"https://www.nist.gov/blogs/taking-measure/measurement-research-could-help-devices-tell-you-if-theyve-been-tampered","url":"https://t.co/l1aQyklj1b"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/pjjPRZCP1P","end":287,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NIST/status/2112958602109473184/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112958599546679296","start":264,"url":"https://t.co/pjjPRZCP1P"}]},"id":"2112958602109473184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1339,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Our phones are constantly emitting silent signals in the form of invisible electromagnetic waveforms. These signals can tell trained experts a slew of information about the device, including whether it has been tampered with. \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/l1aQyklj1b https://t.co/pjjPRZCP1P","url":"https://x.com/NIST/status/2112958602109473184"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-21T16:44:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112948211619098971"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/EzKordem/statu…","end":56,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/EzKordem/status/2112881215275520242","start":33,"url":"https://t.co/f0ebnj2qkS"}]},"id":"2112948211619098971","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":4426,"like_count":92,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":1},"text":"hot take:\n\nmonotheism came first https://t.co/f0ebnj2qkS","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112948211619098971"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112941998285922304"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-21T16:20:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112942130620432724"